          ib: "Full IB Diploma including English HL or SL (minimum grade 4 in English). A predicted total of 27 or more — including TOK/EE bonus points — is the minimum for a provisional offer; more competitive programmes require higher, and U of T publishes no Computer Science-specific IB total. The Calculus and Advanced Functions prerequisites are met by Mathematics: Analysis and Approaches SL or HL, or Mathematics: Applications and Interpretations HL (AI SL meets Advanced Functions only; Math Studies is not acceptable). A Supplemental Application Form is required for Computer Science.",
