          icse: "CISCE is treated together with CBSE — no separate ISC requirements are published, and no India application minimum percentage exists on official sources. Arts requires no specific courses beyond general admission; all English-medium applicants must present at least 70% in junior- or senior-year English. ⚠️ An offer can be re-evaluated if final Standard XII results fall below 85%.",
