          al: "GCSE/GCE standing in at least six academic subject areas, including English, with at least three academic A Levels or six AS Levels; a subject may not be counted at both levels. Arts requires no specific courses beyond general admission. A final grade of A or B in A-Level First Language English or English Literature also meets the English standard."
