          ib: "Complete the full IB Diploma: six subjects with three at Higher Level, no mark lower than 3, and a minimum grade total of 28 EXCLUDING bonus points, plus a competitive score for the programme. ⚠️ For Health Sciences: English, Biology, Chemistry and Mathematics, with a minimum English score of 5 (predicted/final); Mathematics: Applications and Interpretations SL is not acceptable. A mandatory Supplementary Application is also required (on-campus programme only).",
